# boolean-composition-inferred (#189 Slice 0b — case-feature / layered INFERRED lane)
library "Pol".

// A `code is` records concept forces the LocalSource split → the case-feature INFERRED lane. A `defined as`
// BOOLEAN composition (`and`/`or`/`not`) over `defined as exists` operands must lower to a bare compound
// boolean on the Inferred lane (never `.asTruths()` / `union`), and the Interface façade must re-export it
// BARE (a truth-set would be `.satisfied()`). The production KE lane — code review disc 464 asked for it.

concept "Adult Records":
- type is Observation.
- shape is RecordSet.
- code is `adult`.

concept "Senior Records":
- type is Observation.
- shape is RecordSet.
- code is `senior`.

concept "Has Adult":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as exists ( "Adult Records" ).

concept "Has Senior":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as exists ( "Senior Records" ).

concept "Adult And Senior":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as ( "Has Adult" and "Has Senior" ).

concept "Adult Or Not Senior":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as ( "Has Adult" or not "Has Senior" ).

activity "Refer":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Triage":
- when "Adult And Senior" then recommend activity "Refer".
- when "Adult Or Not Senior" then recommend activity "Refer".
